S = {'cc': 'CA', 'fam': 'Corporate', 'doc': '# Canada 2025 (Ontario): federal and Ontario corporate income tax, Part XIII withholding (1200)\n\nSources: Income Tax Act (Justice Laws, current to 2026-10-29; `ca/law/I-3.3.txt`) and Ontario Taxation Act, 2007\n(e-Laws, `ca/law/on_07t11.txt`).\n* **ITA s. 123 (1) (a)** "38% of its amount taxable"; **s. 124 (1)** abatement "10% of the corporation\'s taxable\n  income earned in the year in a province"; **s. 123.4** general rate reduction 13 % (from 2012): 15 %.\n* **s. 125 (1), (1.1) (c)** small business deduction rate "19%" for a Canadian-controlled private corporation on its\n  business limit ($500,000, s. 125 (2)): 9 %. The company flag `ccpc` selects it (all profit taken as active business\n  income).\n* **Ontario Taxation Act, 2007**: general rate "11.5 per cent" (from 1 July 2011); small business deduction "8.3 per\n  cent" (2020 - June 2026): 3.2 % on the first $500,000 (grade B: the business-limit link to the federal one not read).\n* **ITA s. 212 (1)**: "an income tax of 25%" on dividends, rents, royalties and non-arm\'s-length interest paid to\n  non-residents (arm\'s-length interest is exempt: flagged).\n\n**Pass 7 (2026-11-21):** services: ITA s. 212 (1) (a) (Part XIII, `ca/law/I-3.3.txt`): 25 % on a management or administration fee or charge; s. 212 (4): not on a service performed in the ordinary course of the non-resident\'s business when dealing at arm\'s length, nor on specific expense reimbursements. As for interest, the payment is taken as non-arm\'s length: 25 % (flagged).', 'lean': '\ndef isCcpc (co : Company) : Bool := co.flags.contains "ccpc"\n\ndef federal (co : Company) : CorpRegime :=\n  { name := "Federal corporate income tax",\n    sched := if isCcpc co then Schedule.ofList [(0, 900), (500000, 1500)] else Schedule.flat 1500 }\n\ndef ontario (co : Company) : CorpRegime :=\n  { name := "Ontario corporate income tax",\n    sched := if isCcpc co then Schedule.ofList [(0, 320), (500000, 1150)] else Schedule.flat 1150 }\n\ndef wht : Wht :=\n  { name := "Part XIII tax", rules := [\n    { kind := .dividend, rateBp := 2500, statute := "ITA s. 212 (2): 25 %" },\n    { kind := .royalty, rateBp := 2500, statute := "ITA s. 212 (1) (d): 25 %" },\n    { kind := .interest, rateBp := 2500, statute := "ITA s. 212 (1) (b): 25 % (non-arm\'s-length interest only)" },\n    { kind := .services, rateBp := 2500, statute := "ITA s. 212 (1) (a): 25 % on a management or administration fee or charge (non-arm\'s-length; s. 212 (4))" }] }\n\ndef citF : Family :=\n  { name := "1200 federal and Ontario CIT, Part XIII", covers := [.cit, .incomeOther],\n    run := fun _ g _ =>\n      if g.entity != .company then [] else\n      let co := g.company\n      [(federal co).citCharge co "ITA s. 123 (1) (a) 38 %, s. 124 (1) 10 %, s. 123.4 13 %, s. 125 small business 19 %",\n       { (ontario co).citCharge co "Taxation Act, 2007 (Ont.): 11.5 %; small business 8.3 % reduction" with level := .state }]\n      ++ wht.charges co }\n', 'families': '[citF]', 'unsupported': [['g.entity == .company', 'losses brought forward, interest limitation and participation exemptions not modelled: taxable profit = profit + add-backs − exempt income'], ['g.entity == .company', "Ontario small-business limit taken as $500,000 (link to ITA s. 125 (2) not read); active business income = profit; arm's-length interest to non-residents is exempt (ITA s. 212 (1) (b)): not distinguished"], ['g.entity == .company && !g.company.paymentsAbroad.isEmpty', "services: taken as a management or administration fee to a non-arm's-length recipient (ITA s. 212 (1) (a)); arm's-length services in the ordinary course of business (s. 212 (4)) are not taxed"]], 'guards': ['(federal {}).citTax { profit := 1000000 } == 150000', '(federal { flags := ["ccpc"] }).citTax { profit := 1000000 } == 45000 + 75000', '(ontario {}).citTax { profit := 1000000 } == 115000', 'wht.amount { kind := .dividend, amount := 1000 } == 250', 'wht.amount { kind := .services, amount := 1000000 } == 250000'], 'taxes': [{'oecd': '1200', 'tax': 'Federal corporate income tax', 'statute': 'ITA ss. 123, 123.4, 124, 125', 'dated': 'Justice Laws consolidation current to 2026-10-29 (rates unchanged since 2019)', 'grade': 'A', 'package': 'P2', 'kernel_parts': ['CorpRegime'], 'unsupported': ['investment income, GRIP']}, {'oecd': '1200', 'tax': 'Ontario corporate income tax', 'statute': 'Taxation Act, 2007 (Ont.)', 'dated': 'e-Laws consolidation from 2026-07-01 with dated provisions', 'grade': 'B', 'package': 'P2', 'kernel_parts': ['CorpRegime'], 'unsupported': ['small business limit']}, {'oecd': '1200', 'tax': 'Part XIII withholding', 'statute': 'ITA s. 212; s. 212 (1) (a), (4) (management fees; pass 7)', 'dated': 'current consolidation', 'grade': 'A', 'package': 'P2', 'kernel_parts': ['Wht'], 'unsupported': ["arm's-length interest exemption", "services taken as non-arm's-length management fees (s. 212 (4) not distinguished)"]}]}
